{
  "_comment": [
    "Windows Settings pages and Control Panel items (SPEC.md §7.2).",
    "Data-driven on purpose: this file ships beside the executable and can be",
    "updated without a code release. Display names and synonyms are English-only",
    "in v1, an explicit decision (§7.2).",
    "",
    "Each entry: id (stable, provider-scoped), name, uri, optional synonyms, and",
    "an optional gate. Gates: min_build (Windows build number) and requires, one",
    "of battery | cellular | bluetooth | pen | touchpad. The shell evaluates",
    "gates once at startup and hides entries that cannot apply, rather than",
    "launching a URI that silently lands on the Settings home page."
  ],
